{"id":"39","title":"Buying Clothes and Shoes","goal":"Ask about an item, size and availability; describe fit; and decide whether to buy.","language":"en","study":[{"id":"39-study-0","title":"Start here","blocks":[{"id":"ch39-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Useful clothing names include "},{"text":"shirt","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"T-shirt","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"jacket","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"coat","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"dress","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"skirt","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"shorts","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"jeans","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"pants","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"sweater","emphasis":true},{"text":", and "},{"text":"suit","emphasis":true},{"text":". Pants cover the lower body with separate sections for the legs; you may also encounter "},{"text":"trousers","emphasis":true},{"text":". Footwear includes "},{"text":"sneakers","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"boots","emphasis":true},{"text":", "},{"text":"sandals","emphasis":true},{"text":", and "},{"text":"dress shoes","emphasis":true},{"text":"."}],"span":[6,6],"phraseIds":["ch39-p90343288598677","ch39-p224867150841687","ch39-p28767979755415","ch39-p15458066464964","ch39-p142648933443322","ch39-p94152291481249","ch39-p7673784110779","ch39-p173375605610429","ch39-p120718001639692","ch39-p40287195295359","ch39-p13055537602029","ch39-p85462979484842","ch39-p251246747925523","ch39-p119524277982620","ch39-p111566008071250","ch39-p31169647730582"]},{"id":"ch39-b1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Point to a specific item or name it: "},{"text":"Do you have this shirt in blue?","emphasis":true},{"text":" and "},{"text":"Do you have these shoes in a size nine?","emphasis":true},{"text":" ask for another version. "},{"text":"This","emphasis":true},{"text":" fits one shirt; "},{"text":"these","emphasis":true},{"text":" fits a pair of shoes or pants."}],"span":[8,8],"phraseIds":["ch39-p194329874824469","ch39-p33437997307238","ch39-p139815667328082","ch39-p107223497822423"]}],"line":6,"ja":"","theme":"clothes"},{"id":"39-study-1","title":"Trying an item","blocks":[{"id":"ch39-b2","type":"conversation","turns":[{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Do you have this jacket in a medium?"}],"id":"ch39-line12","person":"Customer","en":"Do you have this jacket in a medium?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"We do. Would you like to try it on?"}],"id":"ch39-line13","person":"Employee","en":"We do. Would you like to try it on?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Yes, please. Where are the fitting rooms?"}],"id":"ch39-line14","person":"Customer","en":"Yes, please. Where are the fitting rooms?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"Just over there."}],"id":"ch39-line15","person":"Employee","en":"Just over there.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Thanks. The sleeves feel a little short. Do you have a large?"}],"id":"ch39-line16","person":"Customer","en":"Thanks. The sleeves feel a little short. Do you have a large?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"I'll check. Would you like the same color?"}],"id":"ch39-line17","person":"Employee","en":"I'll check. Would you like the same color?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Yes, the dark green."}],"id":"ch39-line18","person":"Customer","en":"Yes, the dark green.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"}],"span":[12,18],"art":"ch39-scene-0.svg","theme":"clothes","people":["Customer","Employee"],"caption":"Trying an item · Customer & Employee","phraseIds":["ch39-line12","ch39-line13","ch39-line14","ch39-line15","ch39-line16","ch39-line17","ch39-line18"]},{"id":"ch39-b3","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Try it on","emphasis":true},{"text":" means put it on to see how it looks or fits. "},{"text":"A size up","emphasis":true},{"text":" means the next larger size; "},{"text":"a size down","emphasis":true},{"text":" means the next smaller size in the store's labeling system. Give the actual size label when possible rather than assuming every item uses the same fit or numbering."}],"span":[20,20],"phraseIds":["ch39-p254446446996310","ch39-p105640514024859","ch39-p125991705697955"]}],"line":10,"ja":"","theme":"clothes"},{"id":"39-study-2","title":"Describing fit","blocks":[{"id":"ch39-b4","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"It's too tight around the shoulders.","emphasis":true}],"phraseIds":["ch39-p212441187959602"]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"The pants are too loose at the waist.","emphasis":true}],"phraseIds":["ch39-p116955557180654"]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"The sleeves are too long.","emphasis":true}],"phraseIds":["ch39-p80863752915371"]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"These shoes feel narrow.","emphasis":true}],"phraseIds":["ch39-p137381402371223"]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"They fit, but I don't like the color.","emphasis":true}],"phraseIds":["ch39-p131210981850929"]},{"number":null,"runs":[{"text":"This one fits better.","emphasis":true}],"phraseIds":["ch39-p237910272556405"]}],"span":[24,29],"phraseIds":["ch39-p212441187959602","ch39-p116955557180654","ch39-p80863752915371","ch39-p137381402371223","ch39-p131210981850929","ch39-p237910272556405"]},{"id":"ch39-b5","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Too","emphasis":true},{"text":" identifies a problem for your purpose, not simply a noticeable feature. "},{"text":"A little loose","emphasis":true},{"text":" may be a description; "},{"text":"too loose","emphasis":true},{"text":" means you want a different fit."}],"span":[31,31],"phraseIds":["ch39-p54951843611689","ch39-p210409054882459","ch39-p261838736398198"]},{"id":"ch39-b6","type":"conversation","turns":[{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Could I try these in a nine?"}],"id":"ch39-line33","person":"Customer","en":"Could I try these in a nine?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"Sure. How do they feel?"}],"id":"ch39-line34","person":"Employee","en":"Sure. How do they feel?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"They're tight at the front. Do you have a nine and a half?"}],"id":"ch39-line35","person":"Customer","en":"They're tight at the front. Do you have a nine and a half?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"Not in this color, but we have black."}],"id":"ch39-line36","person":"Employee","en":"Not in this color, but we have black.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"I'd rather have blue. Could you check whether another store has them?"}],"id":"ch39-line37","person":"Customer","en":"I'd rather have blue. Could you check whether another store has them?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"},{"speaker":"Employee","runs":[{"text":"I can ask."}],"id":"ch39-line38","person":"Employee","en":"I can ask.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-1490834389.svg"},{"speaker":"Customer","runs":[{"text":"Thanks. If not, I'll keep looking."}],"id":"ch39-line39","person":"Customer","en":"Thanks. If not, I'll keep looking.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-903539973.svg"}],"span":[33,39],"art":"ch39-scene-1.svg","theme":"clothes","people":["Customer","Employee"],"caption":"Describing fit · Customer & Employee","phraseIds":["ch39-line33","ch39-line34","ch39-line35","ch39-line36","ch39-line37","ch39-line38","ch39-line39"]}],"line":22,"ja":"","theme":"clothes"},{"id":"39-study-3","title":"Availability and the decision","blocks":[{"id":"ch39-b7","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Your website shows it in stock","emphasis":true},{"text":" describes information you saw. Follow with "},{"text":"Could you check?","emphasis":true},{"text":", since the employee may need to verify it. "},{"text":"Is this on sale?","emphasis":true},{"text":" asks about the current price. A request such as "},{"text":"What is your return policy?","emphasis":true},{"text":" belongs before a purchase when you need that information; Chapter 40 practices returns in more detail."}],"span":[43,43],"phraseIds":["ch39-p273297015244399","ch39-p84897206322441","ch39-p183610964944453","ch39-p70453452183416"]},{"id":"ch39-b8","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"You can accept: "},{"text":"I'll take this one.","emphasis":true},{"text":" Decline: "},{"text":"It doesn't fit the way I want.","emphasis":true},{"text":" Or delay: "},{"text":"I'm going to think about it. Thanks for your help.","emphasis":true},{"text":" You do not owe the employee a positive opinion about every item."}],"span":[45,45],"phraseIds":["ch39-p218846951927866","ch39-p170988791467604","ch39-p3144813930413"]}],"line":41,"ja":"","theme":"clothes"},{"id":"39-words","title":"Words & phrases","blocks":[{"id":"39-glossary","type":"vocabulary","phraseIds":["ch39-v0","ch39-v1","ch39-v2","ch39-v3"]}]}],"practice":[{"id":"39-practice-0","title":"Take your turn","blocks":[{"id":"ch39-b9","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Use these fictional stock facts: green jacket—medium and large; blue sneakers—size 9 only; black sneakers—9 and 9½. Read both roles alone or switch with a partner."}],"span":[49,49]},{"id":"ch39-b10","type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"number":1,"runs":[{"text":"Request the medium jacket, then explain that the sleeves are too short and ask for a larger size."}],"id":"ch39-b10-0"},{"number":2,"runs":[{"text":"Request blue sneakers in 9½. The employee offers black. Accept the alternative or explain that you prefer blue."}],"id":"ch39-b10-1"},{"number":3,"runs":[{"text":"Ask about the return policy before deciding. The employee says "},{"text":"I'll show you our written policy.","emphasis":true},{"text":" Ask where to find it or thank them."}],"id":"ch39-b10-2"}],"span":[51,53]}],"line":49,"ja":"","theme":"clothes","answers":[{"id":"ch39-b11","type":"answer","runs":[{"text":"Sample possibilities:","emphasis":true},{"text":" “Do you have this in a medium?” — “Yes.” — “The sleeves are too short. Could I try a large?” / “I'd prefer blue. I'll keep looking, thanks.” / “What's your return policy?” — “I'll show you.” — “Great, thank you.”"}],"span":[55,55]},{"id":"ch39-b12","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Try again later with a different item and fit problem. Check that you named the item, requested a usable size or alternative, and made your decision clear."}],"span":[57,57]}]}],"phrases":[{"id":"ch39-p90343288598677","en":"shirt","section":"39-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch39-p90343288598677"},{"id":"ch39-p224867150841687","en":"T-shirt","section":"39-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch39-p224867150841687"},{"art":"word-jacket.svg","id":"ch39-p28767979755415","en":"jacket","section":"39-study-0","context":"An outer piece of clothing for your upper body.","kind":"word","studyId":"ch39-p28767979755415"},{"id":"ch39-p15458066464964","en":"coat","section":"39-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch39-p15458066464964"},{"id":"ch39-p142648933443322","en":"dress","section":"39-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch39-p142648933443322"},{"id":"ch39-p94152291481249","en":"skirt","section":"39-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch39-p94152291481249"},{"id":"ch39-p7673784110779","en":"shorts","section":"39-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch39-p7673784110779"},{"id":"ch39-p173375605610429","en":"jeans","section":"39-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch39-p173375605610429"},{"id":"ch39-p120718001639692","en":"pants","section":"39-study-0","context":"Start here","kind":"word","studyId":"ch39-p120718001639692"},